# MUCL Component Catalog

All components are exported from `@uxe/mucl`. Import with:
```vue
import { MButton, MInput, MModal } from '@uxe/mucl';
```

Components auto-register when using the MUCL resolver (`@uxe/mucl/resolver`), so they can be used directly in templates as `<m-button>`, `<m-input>`, etc.

## Natural Language → Component Mapping

**This design system was built to serve this family of applications.** When a user describes a UI pattern, the AI must map their language to MUCL components **before writing any markup**. This table bridges everyday descriptions to specific components.

| User says… | MUCL component(s) | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| "accordion," "collapsible," "expandable section," "toggle section" | `m-accordion` | Supports nesting, custom header content via `#header` slot |
| "tree," "nested list," "hierarchy," "guideline tree," "criteria tree," "the accordion thing" | `m-accordion` (nested) | m-accordion inside m-accordion. Also check snippet catalog for domain-specific trees |
| "admission criteria," "review criteria," "care guidelines," "clinical criteria," "clinical guidelines," "guideline," "indications" | `m-accordion` (nested) + guideline tree snippet | **Always check snippet-catalog.mdc first.** These terms map to the sanctioned guideline tree/row assets. |
| "tabs," "tab bar," "switch between sections" | `m-tab-list` | |
| "dropdown," "select," "picker," "choose from a list" | `m-select` | For menu-style dropdowns, also consider `m-menu` |
| "menu," "context menu," "right-click menu," "action menu" | `m-menu` + `m-menu-item` | |
| "popup," "popover," "floating panel," "anchored overlay" | `m-popup` | |
