| "badge," "tag," "label," "status indicator," "pill" | `m-badge` | For interactive tags, use `m-chip` |
| "chip," "filter chip," "removable tag" | `m-chip` | |
| "table," "grid," "data table," "list of records," "spreadsheet" | `m-datatable` | |
| "code reference," "lookup table," "formulary list," "categorized list with pagination" | `m-datatable` + reference-table snippet | See snippet-catalog.mdc |
