## Composition Patterns

Common ways to compose MUCL components for complex UI:

| Pattern | Composition |
|---|---|
| **Tree / hierarchy** | `m-accordion` nested inside `m-accordion`. Use `#header` slot for row content, default slot for children. `header-only` prop for leaf nodes. |
| **Form** | `m-card` containing `m-input`, `m-select`, `m-checkbox`, `m-textarea` with `m-button` for actions. Wire up `v-model` bindings. |
| **Dashboard** | Grid of `m-card` components. Use `m-badge` for status metrics, `.m-heading-*` for labels. |
| **Data page** | `m-card` with summary badges/stats at top, `m-datatable` below. |
| **Tabbed content** | `m-tab-list` controlling which `m-card` section is visible via `v-if`/`v-show`. |
| **Confirmation flow** | `m-button` triggering `m-modal-confirmation`. Wire `@confirm` and `@cancel` events. |
| **Side-by-side comparison** | `m-split-view` with `m-card` in each pane. |
| **Searchable list** | `m-search` above `m-datatable` with filtered data. |

## Button Components

### MButton
Primary interactive button. Wraps in a `<span class="m-button-container">`.

| Prop | Type | Default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `label` | string | `''` | Button text |
| `icon` | string | `''` | Font Awesome icon name (e.g. `'check'`, `'trash'`) |
| `iconStyle` | `'solid' \| 'regular' \| 'brands' \| 'custom'` | `'solid'` | FA style |
| `use` | `'m-filled' \| 'm-outline' \| 'm-text' \| 'm-negative' \| 'm-inverted'` | `'m-outline'` | Visual style |
| `size` | string | `'standard'` | `'standard'` or `'small'` |
| `disabled` | boolean | `false` | |
| `processing` | boolean | `false` | Shows spinner, disables click |
| `selected` | boolean | `false` | Selected state |
| `hideLabel` | boolean | `false` | Visually hides label (screen-reader accessible) |
| `type` | string | `'button'` | HTML button type |
| `containerClass` | string | `''` | Class on outer span |

Emits: `click`

### MButtonDropdown / MButtonMenu / MButtonPopup
Buttons that open a dropdown, menu, or popup respectively. Extend MButton with toggle behavior.

### MButtonLink
Button styled as a hyperlink.

### MSplitButton
Split button with a primary action and a dropdown for secondary actions.

## Input Components

### MInput
Text input with validation, labels, and help text. Generic over value type.

| Prop | Type | Default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `v-model` | `string \| number \| null` | — | Two-way binding. Supports `.trim` and `.number` modifiers |
| `label` | string | `''` | Input label |
| `labelPosition` | `'floating' \| 'top' \| 'side' \| 'fixed'` | `'floating'` | |
| `type` | `'text' \| 'email' \| 'number' \| 'password' \| 'search' \| 'tel' \| 'url' \| 'file'` | `'text'` | |
| `placeholder` | string | `''` | |
| `helpText` | string | `''` | Hint text below input |
| `required` | boolean | `false` | Shows asterisk |
| `disabled` | boolean | `false` | |
| `readonly` | boolean | `false` | |
| `clearable` | boolean | `false` | Shows clear button |
| `icon` | string | `''` | Appended icon |
| `rules` | `ValidationRule[]` | `[]` | Quasar validation rules |
| `min`, `max` | number/string | — | Min/max constraints |
| `minlength`, `maxlength` | number | — | Character limits |

Slots: `append`

### MTextarea
Multi-line text input. Similar props to MInput plus resize control (`'both' \| 'horizontal' \| 'vertical' \| 'none'`).

### MInlineInput
Inline editable text field.

### MNumericUnitInput
Number input with a unit label.

### MSearch
Search-specific input with search icon and clear behavior.

### MSelect
Dropdown select. Accepts `IOption` items (string, number, or `Record<string, unknown>`). Use `useIOptionKeyValue` composable to map custom objects.

### MDatePicker
Date picker. Values use ISO format: `YYYY-MM-DD`.

### MTimePicker
Time picker. Values use `HH:MM` format.

### MCheckbox
Checkbox input with label.

### MRadio / MRadioGroup
Radio button and radio button group.

### MSwitch
Toggle switch. Label position controlled by `position: 'before' \| 'after' \| 'hidden'`.

## Data Display

### MDatatable
Full-featured data table with sorting, column selection, and row click handlers.

### MDatatablePagination
Standalone pagination for datatables. Uses `MPaginationProp`:
```ts
{ page: number; rowsPerPage: number; sortBy?: string; descending?: boolean; rowsNumber?: number }
```

### MPagination
General-purpose pagination controls.

### MBadge
Non-interactive status label.

| Prop | Notes |
|---|---|
| `variant` | See BadgeVariants: `'m-accent'`, `'m-positive'`, `'m-negative'`, `'m-warning'`, `'m-info'`, `'m-highlight'`, subtle variants (`'m-accent-subtle'`, `'m-positive-subtle'`, `'m-negative-subtle'`, `'m-warning-subtle'`, `'m-info-subtle'`, `'m-highlight-subtle'`), section types (`'m-problem'`, `'m-question'`, `'m-barrier'`), and all product codes |
| `icon` | Optional leading icon |
| `label` | Badge text |

### MChip
Interactive compact element for choices, filters, or attributes.

Variants: `'m-accent'`, `'m-positive'`, `'m-negative'`, `'m-warning'`, `'m-info'`, `'m-highlight'`.

### MSegmentText
Renders text with highlighted segments.

### MIcon
Icon wrapper for Font Awesome. Key props: `icon` (name), `iconStyle` (`'solid' \| 'regular' \| 'brands' \| 'custom'`), `variant`, `size`, `rotation` (`'90' \| '180' \| '270'`).

Icon variants: all PersistentVariants plus `'m-dark'` and `'m-inverse'`.

**Icon style as state indicator:** Many icons have both `solid` (filled, default) and `regular` (outlined) variants. Use the style switch to communicate state — e.g., `note-sticky` with `icon-style="regular"` for "empty/no content" and `icon-style="solid"` for "has content." This is a common pattern across the product and should be preferred over swapping icon names to show state changes.

## Layout & Containers

### MCard
Container card.

| Prop | Notes |
|---|---|
| `use` | `'m-bordered'` (default border), `'m-tonal'` (shaded bg), `'m-interactive'` (hover effect) |

### MAccordion
Collapsible content sections with expand/collapse toggle. Supports nesting for tree structures.

| Prop | Type | Default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `v-model:expanded` | boolean | `false` | Two-way binding for expand/collapse state |
| `headerText` | string | `''` | Simple header text (alternative to `#header` slot) |
| `headerClass` | string/object | `''` | CSS class on the header wrapper |
| `contentClass` | string/object | `''` | CSS class on the content wrapper |
| `headerOnly` | boolean | `false` | Header only, no toggle button, no expandable content. Use for leaf nodes in trees. |
| `iconClosed` | string | `'caret-right'` | Icon when collapsed |
| `iconExpanded` | string | `'caret-down'` | Icon when expanded |
| `disabled` | boolean | `false` | Disables expand/collapse |
| `hidden` | boolean | `false` | Hides the accordion entirely (not in DOM) |
| `verticalRule` | boolean | `false` | Shows a vertical line on the left of content |
| `horizontalRule` | boolean | `false` | Shows a horizontal divider after content |
| `insetLevel` | number | `0` | Left margin multiplier. **Do not use for nested trees** — nesting provides natural indentation. Only for stacked (flat) accordions. |
| `toggleAriaLabel` | string | `'Accordion toggle'` | Screen reader label for the toggle button |

Slots: `header` (custom header content), `default` (expandable content — receives `{ disabled }`)

**Nesting:** Place `m-accordion` inside `m-accordion`'s default slot. Content area auto-resets padding to 0 when it contains nested accordions. Content has `margin-left: var(--m-28)` providing natural indentation per level.

**Circle-caret icons:** Use `icon-closed="circle-caret-right"` and `icon-expanded="circle-caret-down"` for a filled circle toggle (e.g., "documented" state in clinical trees).

### MSplitView
Two-pane split layout.

### MSkeleton
Loading placeholder with shimmer animation.

### MSpinner
Loading spinner. Sizes: `'s'` (24px), `'m'` (32px), `'l'` (48px), `'xl'` (64px).

### MLogo
MCG brand logo.

## Overlays

### MModal
Modal dialog.

| Prop | Type | Default |
|---|---|---|
| `v-model` | boolean | `false` |
| `titleText` | string | — |
| `titleIcon` | string | — |
| `subtitleText` | string | — |
| `position` | `'standard' \| 'top' \| 'left' \| 'right' \| 'bottom'` | `'standard'` |
| `persistent` | boolean | `false` |
| `maximized` | boolean | `false` |
| `fullWidth` | boolean | `false` |
| `fullHeight` | boolean | `false` |
| `seamless` | boolean | `false` |

Emits: `confirm`, `cancel`, `dismiss`, `activator:click`, `update:modelValue`

**Critical slot usage:** The **default slot replaces the entire modal card** (header, body, actions). To place content inside the modal while keeping the title bar and action footer, use the `#content` slot. Available slots: `activator`, `header`, `content` (body), `actions`, `close`, `default` (replaces everything).

### MModalAlert
Alert modal with a single action button.
Extra props: `actionText`, `confirmationText`.

### MModalConfirmation
Confirmation modal with primary and secondary actions.
Extra props: `primaryActionText`, `secondaryActionText`, `confirmationText`.

### MPopup
Popup overlay anchored to a trigger element.

### MTooltip
Tooltip wrapper using Tippy.js. Wrap any element to add a tooltip on hover/focus.

### MSidePanel
Slide-in side panel. Responsive widths: desktop 550px, tablet 400px, mobile 100vw.

## Navigation

### MMenu
Floating menu with submenu support.

### MMenuItem
Individual menu item. Props: `label`, `caption`, `link`, `value`.

### MTabList
Tab navigation. Sizes: `'small'`, `'medium'`, `'large'`.

## Composables

| Composable | Import | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `useForm` | `@uxe/mucl` | Form state: validation, dirty tracking, error collection |
| `useValidation` | `@uxe/mucl` | Per-field validation rules and error handling |
| `useModal` | `@uxe/mucl` | Programmatic modals: `alert()` and `confirm()` |
| `useToast` | `@uxe/mucl` | Toast notifications: `success()`, `error()`, `info()` |
| `useFocusWithin` | `@uxe/mucl` | Keyboard focus management (arrow keys, wrap) |
| `usePopupPosition` | `@uxe/mucl` | Position popup relative to trigger element |
| `useListeners` | `@uxe/mucl` | Collect `on*` event listeners from `$attrs` |
| `useGlobalComponent` | `@uxe/mucl` | Mount components outside the app tree |
| `useIOptionKeyValue` | `@uxe/mucl` | Map objects to `{ value, label }` for selects |

## Variant Systems

Components share a consistent variant vocabulary via CSS classes:

**Persistent (semantic) variants:** `'m-accent'`, `'m-positive'`, `'m-negative'`, `'m-warning'`, `'m-info'`, `'m-disabled'`, `'m-problem'`, `'m-question'`, `'m-barrier'`

**Button use styles:** `'m-filled'`, `'m-outline'`, `'m-text'`, `'m-negative'`, `'m-inverted'`

**Card use styles:** `'m-bordered'`, `'m-tonal'`, `'m-interactive'`

**Product variants:** `'m-ac'`, `'m-bhc'`, `'m-cc'`, `'m-grc'`, `'m-hc'`, `'m-isc'`, `'m-mcm'`, `'m-mcr'`, `'m-pi'`, `'m-rfc'`, `'m-tc'`

